ight=\"425\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-14290\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma.png 625w, https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-300x204.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-630b3d7\" data-id=\"630b3d7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d41231d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d41231d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pharmaceuticals<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-488787f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"488787f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In the highly regulated pharmaceutical industry, precision and compliance are paramount. At Raj Barcode, we offer a comprehensive range of solutions tailored to meet the unique challenges of pharmaceutical manufacturing, distribution, and supply chain management.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b010207 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b010207\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-95cf2ed\" data-id=\"95cf2ed\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01579a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"01579a4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\"><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper center   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Our Applications In This Industry<\/h2><div class=\"ekit_heading_separetor_wraper ekit_heading_elementskit-border-divider ekit-dotted\"><div class=\"elementskit-border-divider ekit-dotted\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3d73175 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3d73175\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-e4225fb\" data-id=\"e4225fb\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c895962 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"c895962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/pharma-1-qk63kmr443f53u5igd5bhd03xdf3ygn1b286rvzi8m.png\" title=\"pharma\" alt=\"pharma\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        1. Warehouse Management\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Efficient warehouse management is essential for maintaining product integrity and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. Our Warehouse Management System (WMS) provides pharmaceutical companies with real-time visibility into inventory levels, facilitates accurate stock tracking, and streamlines order fulfillment processes.                     <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-896f2d4\" data-id=\"896f2d4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db1fd33 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"db1fd33\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"350\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14291\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2-1.png 500w, https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2-1-300x210.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        2. Work In Progress Tracking\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Tracking work in progress (WIP) is critical for optimizing manufacturing processes and ensuring timely production. Our Work In Progress Tracking solution enables pharmaceutical manufacturers to monitor the status of each production batch in real-time, identify potential bottlenecks, and proactively address issues to minimize downtime and maximize efficiency.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-da2d0b1\" data-id=\"da2d0b1\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6f3cfa ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"d6f3cfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/pharma-3-qk63ki1x5x8phscc7t46mw6syg29vz4dmeyrdi6h3q.png\" title=\"pharma (3)\" alt=\"pharma (3)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        3. Machine Vision\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Maintaining product quality and integrity is non-negotiable in the pharmaceutical industry. Our Machine Vision solutions leverage cutting-edge technology to inspect and verify product packaging, labels, and components with unparalleled accuracy and speed. By detecting defects and deviations early in the production process, pharmaceutical companies can uphold the highest quality standards and minimize the risk of product recalls.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-1b9ef87 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1b9ef87\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-39bebbb\" data-id=\"39bebbb\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0830145 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"0830145\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/pharma-2-qk63k5u0p2rzauu375u18h9t8fqi3wrv8qhg4wolcm.png\" title=\"pharma (2)\" alt=\"pharma (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        4. Label Managment Solution\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Accurate labeling is essential for compliance with regulatory requirements and ensuring product traceability. Raj Barcode's Label Management Solution simplifies the creation, printing, and management of pharmaceutical labels, incorporating industry-specific data such as serial numbers, expiration dates, and batch codes. With customizable label templates and seamless integration with GS1 standards, our solution helps pharmaceutical companies meet regulatory requirements and enhance patient safety.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-66f884a\" data-id=\"66f884a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-879323d ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"879323d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"625\" height=\"425\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-14289\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2.png 625w, https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/pharma-2-300x204.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        5. Track and Trace\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Traceability is a cornerstone of pharmaceutical supply chain management, enabling rapid identification and containment of product recalls or quality issues. Our Track and Trace solution provides end-to-end visibility into product movements, from manufacturing facilities to distribution centers and pharmacies. By leveraging serialization and GS1 standards, pharmaceutical companies can track individual units throughout the supply chain, mitigate risks, and safeguard patient health                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-c951be5\" data-id=\"c951be5\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ca0548 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-image-box\" data-id=\"0ca0548\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n            <div class=\"elementskit-info-image-box ekit-image-box text-center style-modern\">\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-header image-box-img-center\">\n\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/rajbarcode.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/smart-warehouse-management-system-using-augmented-reality-technology_31965-11938-qk2lm6hsr63j7yp3gtnbk443e15kfc6ivlynit9gra.jpg\" title=\"smart-warehouse-management-system-using-augmented-reality-technology_31965-11938\" alt=\"smart-warehouse-management-system-using-augmented-reality-technology_31965-11938\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n                <\/div>\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-box-body ekit-image-box-body\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-content ekit-image-box-body-inner\">\n                                                <h5 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n\n                        6. Mobilizing ERP\n                        \n                    <\/h5>\n                                                            <div class=\"elementskit-box-style-content\">\n                        Access to real-time data is essential for informed decision-making and regulatory compliance in the pharmaceutical industry. Our Mobilizing ERP solution extends the capabilities of Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) systems to mobile devices, enabling seamless access to critical information such as inventory levels, production schedules, and regulatory documentation. With enhanced mobility and connectivity, pharmaceutical companies can improve operational efficiency and ensure compliance with US FDA 21 CFR and GMP standards.                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6d0d4d4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-defaul